# chief runtime artefacts. The PRDs themselves (.chief/prds/*/prd.md) and the
# accumulated codebase notes (progress.md) are tracked deliberately — they are
# the project's memory. Everything below is per-machine and large: worktrees
# carry a full node_modules and a built .app, and the agent transcripts run to
# several MB apiece.
.chief/worktrees/
.chief/**/*.log
.chief/usage.json

.DS_Store
